---
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro';

const updated = '17 September 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy | Canopy"
  description="What Canopy collects on this website, why, where it goes, and how to have it removed."
>
  <div class="legal">
    <div class="shell legal__inner">
      <p class="section-kicker">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="legal__lead">
        This policy covers <strong>canopy.ag</strong>, our marketing website. It describes what
        this site collects, why, and who it reaches. Customers using the Canopy platform are
        covered by the agreement with their organization, not by this page.
      </p>
      <p class="legal__meta">Last updated {updated}</p>

      <h2>What this site collects</h2>
      <p>
        One thing: the demo request form. When you submit it, we receive the company name,
        your name, your email address, your phone number, the company size you select, and
        anything you write in the message field. Your IP address is sent with the submission
        so we can tell a genuine enquiry from automated abuse.
      </p>
      <p>
        We run no analytics, advertising, or session-recording trackers on this site, and we
        set no cookies for those purposes. Reading these pages leaves us nothing.
      </p>

      <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
      <p>
        To reply to your enquiry and to decide whether Canopy is a fit for your operation.
        That is the only purpose. We do not sell it, rent it, or share it with advertisers,
        and we do not add you to a marketing list because you asked for a demo.
      </p>

      <h2>Where it goes</h2>
      <p>
        A demo submission is validated by a function running on Vercel, our hosting provider,
        and forwarded over an encrypted connection to a database Canopy operates on its own
        infrastructure. If that database cannot be reached, the submission is emailed to
        Canopy through Resend instead, so an enquiry is never silently lost. Vercel and
        Resend process the data on our behalf and are not permitted to use it for their own
        purposes.
      </p>
      <p>
        Access is limited to people at Canopy who need it to respond to you.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep demo enquiries while there is a live conversation and for a reasonable
        period afterwards, so we can pick up where we left off if you come back. When an
        enquiry is clearly finished and you have not asked us to keep it, we delete it.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        Write to <a href="mailto:hello@canopy.ag">hello@canopy.ag</a> and ask for a copy of
        what we hold about you, a correction, or deletion. We will act on it. You do not
        need an account or a specific form of words, and we will not ask why.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If this policy changes in a way that affects what we do with information already
        given to us, we will say so here and update the date above.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy go to
        <a href="mailto:hello@canopy.ag">hello@canopy.ag</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal {
    padding: 8rem 0 6rem;
  }
  .legal__inner {
    max-width: 46rem;
  }
  .legal h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem;
  }
  .legal h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
  }
  .legal p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.62);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .legal__lead {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75) !important;
  }
  .legal__meta {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35) !important;
    margin-bottom: 2rem !important;
  }
  .legal a {
    color: #22c55e;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .legal a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .legal strong {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  }
  .legal ul {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.62);
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .legal li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
